ent, a teacher, a doctor. an (আন) বসে যখন উচ্চারণ স্বরধ্বনি (a, e, i, o, u) দিয়ে শুরু হয় → an engineer, an apple, an old man."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"⚠️ নিয়মটা বানান নয়, উচ্চারণ অনুযায়ী। তাই — an hour (আওয়ার, h চুপ) কিন্তু a university (ইউনিভার্সিটি, \"ইউ\" ধ্বনি)। একাধিক হলে a/an বসে না → They are farmers. (❌ They are a farmers.)"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ৫ — Structure 2 : অবস্থা বা অনুভূতি বলা"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Subject + am / is / are + Adjective"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"অর্থ: \"কে কেমন\" — মন, শরীর বা গুণ বোঝাতে। এখানে a / an বসে না।"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"উদাহরণ (১০টি)"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am happy.  →  আমি খুশি।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am hungry.  →  আমার ক্ষুধা লেগেছে।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You are right.  →  তুমি ঠিক বলেছ।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"He is busy.  →  সে ব্যস্ত।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"She is sick.  →  সে অসুস্থ।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"It is cold today.  →  আজ ঠান্ডা।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We are ready.  →  আমরা প্রস্তুত।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"They are tired.  →  তারা ক্লান্ত।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"My father is honest.  →  আমার বাবা সৎ।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[