  values (v_part_1, 'Present Indefinite Tense', 'lesson-03', 'Lesson 3 from English Foundation.', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"প্রতিদিনের কাজ ও অভ্যাসের কথা বলা"}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🎯 এই Lesson শেষে তুমি যা পারবে"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১. প্রতিদিন কী করো — সব ইংরেজিতে বলতে পারবে (রুটিন, অভ্যাস, পেশা)।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২. He / She / It-এর সাথে verb-এ s / es কখন বসে, নিখুঁতভাবে বুঝবে।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩. Negative বানাতে পারবে: I don''t go / He doesn''t go."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৪. প্রশ্ন করতে পারবে: Do you…? / Does he…? এবং Wh-প্রশ্ন।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৫. always, usually, often, sometimes, never — কোথায় বসে শিখবে।"}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🔄 শুরুর আগে — Lesson 2 ঝালাই করো"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১. ____ are my books. (কাছে)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২. He ____ a bicycle. (have/has)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩. \"child\"-এর plural?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৪. \"তার কোনো টাকা নেই\" — ইংরেজি করো। উত্তর:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. These"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2. has"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"3. children"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"4. He doesn''t have any money."}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ১ — Tense (কাল) কী?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"কাজটা কখন হচ্ছে — এখন, আগে, নাকি পরে — সেটা বোঝানোর জন্য verb-এর যে রূপ বদল হয