  values (v_part_1, 'Present Continuous Tense', 'lesson-04', 'Lesson 4 from English Foundation.', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"এই মুহূর্তে যা ঘটছে, তা বলা"}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🎯 এই Lesson শেষে তুমি যা পারবে"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১. এখন কী করছো — ইংরেজিতে বলতে পারবে (I am reading now.)।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২. verb-এর সাথে ing বসানোর ৪টি নিয়ম শিখবে।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩. Negative ও Question বানাতে পারবে।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৪. Present Indefinite আর Present Continuous-এর পার্থক্য পরিষ্কার বুঝবে (এটাই সবচেয়ে জরুরি)।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৫. যে verb-গুলোতে ing বসে না, সেগুলো চিনবে।"}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🔄 শুরুর আগে — Lesson 3 ঝালাই করো"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১. He ____ (go) to school."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২. They ____ (play) football."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩. না-বাচক করো: She likes tea."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৪. প্রশ্ন করো: He works here. উত্তর:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. goes"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2. play"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"3. She doesn''t like tea."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"4. Does he work here?"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ১ — Present Continuous কী?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"কাজটা এই মুহূর্তে চলছে — শেষ হয়নি — এমন বোঝাতে এই tense ব্যবহার হয়। বাংলায় বাক্যের শেষে থাকে \"করছি, করছে, করছো, যাচ্ছে, খাচ্ছি\"।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Subject  +  am / is / are  +  Verb + ing"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Subject"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Verb"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"উদাহরণ"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"বাংলা"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"I"}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"am + ing"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"I am reading."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"আমি পড়ছি।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"He / She / It"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"is + ing"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"He is reading."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"সে পড়ছে।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We / You / They"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"are + ing"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"They are reading."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"তারা পড়ছে।"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"💡 লক্ষ্য করো Lesson 1-এর am / is / are এখানেই আবার কাজে লাগছে। নতুন কিছু নয় — শুধু পরে verb + ing যোগ হলো। am / is / are ছাড়া শুধু ing দিয়ে বাক্য হয় না → ❌ I reading now."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ I am reading now."}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"১.১ কখন ব্যবহার হয়?"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ব্যবহার"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"উদাহরণ"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"বাংলা"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"এই মুহূর্তে ঘটছে"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"I am eating now."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"আমি এখন খাচ্ছি।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"আজকাল চলছে (সাময়িক)"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"He is learning English these days."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"সে আজকাল ইংরেজি শিখছে।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"খুব কাছের ভবিষ্যৎ পরিকল্পনা"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"I am going to Dhaka tomorrow."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"আমি কাল ঢাকা যাচ্ছি।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"বিরক্তিকর অভ্যাস (always সহ)"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"He is always making noise."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"সে সবসময় শব্দ করতেই থাকে।"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"সাথে যে শব্দগুলো প্রায়ই থাকে: now (নাউ, এখন), right now (এই মুহূর্তে), at present (বর্তমানে), today (আজ), these days (আজকাল), look! / listen! (দেখো! / শোনো!)"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ২ — ing বসানোর ৪টি নিয়ম"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"নিয়ম"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"কখন"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"উদাহরণ"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"+ ing"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"সাধারণ সব verb"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"go → going,  play → playing,  read → reading"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"e বাদ দিয়ে + ing"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"শেষে চুপ থাকা \"e\" থাকলে"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"write → writing,  come → coming,  take → taking"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"শেষ অক্ষর দ্বিগুণ + ing"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ছোট স্বর + একটি ব্যঞ্জন দিয়ে শেষ"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"run → running,  sit → sitting,  swim → swimming,  put → putting"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ie → y + ing"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"শেষে ie থাকলে"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"lie → lying,  die → dying,  tie → tying"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"⚠️ দ্বিগুণ করার নিয়মটা একটু খেয়াল করো run = র + উ + ন → ছোট স্বর \"u\", শেষে একটি \"n\" → running read = এখানে \"ea\" লম্বা স্বর → দ্বিগুণ হবে না → reading মনে রাখার সহজ উপায়: শব্দটা যদি ছোট ও ঝটপট উচ্চারিত হয় (run, sit, cut, get, put, swim, stop, plan), তাহলে শেষ অক্ষর দ্বিগুণ।"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"২.১ ১৫টি উদাহরণ"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am reading a book now.  →  আমি এখন একটা বই পড়ছি।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"He is writing a letter.  →  সে একটা চিঠি লিখছে।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"She is cooking in the kitchen.  →  সে রান্নাঘরে রান্না করছে।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We are playing cricket.  →  আমরা ক্রিকেট খেলছি।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"They are watching TV.  →  তারা টিভি দেখছে।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"It is raining outside.  →  বাইরে বৃষ্টি হচ্ছে।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","con